  "source": {
    "description": "Light mode, typography, geometry, shadow, motion, Sidebar source and UI effects: the owner's saved Pocketmarket Custom theme, exported as portable Theme JSON and promoted on 2026-10-17. It replaces the original Pocketmarket stylesheet (2026-10-16). Dark mode: the original stylesheet's dark set, refined on 2026-10-17 to follow the promoted light design language (see darkRefinement). Neither source is committed or rendered as a second theme layer.",
    "notPromoted": "From the saved custom theme, only design values are used. Its id, name, revision and $extensions display name stay local to that saved copy; the built-in keeps id pocketmarket, name Pocketmarket and revision 1. sidebar.dedicatedValuesInitialized is internal bookkeeping and is set by the built-in itself, because its dedicated Sidebar values are in use."
  },
  "precisionPolicy": {
    "color": "Canonical OKLCH through packages/core/src/theme/color.ts normalizeColor. Every source value is already OKLCH, so normalization changes no value; no value is converted through another space."
